        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-09T14:51:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>However, the key idea behind promor character is not to increase their power, but to change they way they play. Whether you like B:EoW or not, I tihnk it does this quite well.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is the most important thing anyone should take away</p>",
